/// One raid (Go guilds.RaidView). A locked raid takes no sign-up from a member; an officer may still write. match, night, attendance and report fill after the night (null before a log is matched).
public struct RaidView: Codable, Sendable, Equatable {
    public let id: Int64
    public let zone: String
    public let zoneName: String
    public let title: String
    public let startsAt: Date
    /// When invites go out, before starts_at (the pull); null when the guild sets none. The web form sets it and raid.starting fires at it minus the lead (lane F4 contract, handler pending: omitted until the column exists, which reads as null).
